  "project_description": "Back to top \n\n INTRODUCTION \n The Netcall AI Widget module allows sites to embed the Netcall AI widget on their website.\n\n You can enable it sitewide so it appears on all pages. Once that is done, you can override it on a page-by-page basis or site-section basis to show other versions of the widget in other places.\n\n Back to top \n\n REQUIREMENTS \n This module has no other requirements.\n\n Back to top \n\n INSTALLATION \n Install as you would normally install a contributed Drupal module.\n\nSee: https://www.drupal.org/node/895232 for further information.\n\n Back to top \n\n CONFIGURATION \n - Configuration settings page: /admin/config/services/netcall/ai-widget\n\n- Permissions page: /admin/people/permissions/module/netcall_ai_widget\n\n Back to top",
